      <characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Cataphractii Terminator armour affords a +2 armour save and a 4+ Invulnerable save. No Run moves, Overwatch attacks, or Sweeping Advance. </characteristic></characteristics></profile>
