        <selectionEntry name="Enhanced Warriors" id="6faa-9b63-c18b-ccd7" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="6" type="upgrade">
          <comment>Note: According to CA: 2003, page 94 only non-marked CSM can be enhanced</comment>
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="ba18-fc9b-cd5c-75b7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1" />
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="0" />
          </costs>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" type="increment" value="3">
              <repeats>
                <repeat childId="7e1e-fb2b-76b8-185e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" repeats="1" roundUp="false" scope="parent" shared="true" value="1" />
              </repeats>
            </modifier>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="aa0f-f088-08fa-7dae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1" />
                    <condition childId="228f-2438-d2d1-998b" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0" />
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Enhanced Warriors" id="a3ac-d921-89c5-71f7" hidden="false">
              <description>Fabius Bile can 'enhance' Chaos Space Marine Squads under his command for +3 pts per model. Before each battle, after both sides have set up but before the first turn, roll a D6 for each enhanced squad and consult the below:
1 - Beserk Rage! Make an armour save for each warrior, removing any who fail. Those who are removed count as casualties for the purposes of Victory points. All survivors are +1 Strength
2-5 - Stable Mutation. The enhanced warriors are +1 Strength and +1 Initiative
6 - Created a Monster! Each warrior adds +1 Strength, +1 Initiative and +1 Attack. Unfortunately, all these warriors will perish at the end of the game and so even the survivors will count as casualties for the purposes of Victory points.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
