                <rule id="125f-a3e7-60d7-1b00-f9b7f" name="Hellish Demise" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>when the rapier loses its last wound, roll as D6

1. Place a Large Blast on the table with the Rapier as the centre. All models under the template take a single Str 3 AP - hit with Soul Blaze. Remove the rapier as normal after this.

2-5. Is removed as normal

6. It explodes as it's a 1 result. In addition, a marker is placed where the rapier was, and any unit with Daemon that Deep Strikes within 6" does not scatter.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
