          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The vehicle gains Preferred Enemy (Blood Angels) and doesn't treat defence lines and barricades as Dangerous Terrain.  If the vehicle is fitted with Destroyer Blades, the damage inflicted from a Tank Shock attack (after Death or Glory) has an AP value equal to the number of Hull Points left (with over 6 being "-")</characteristic>
