    <selectionEntry id="350c-afa9-e426-486c-f9b7f" name="The Tormented" hidden="true" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="15b6-062a-6aff-d295-f9b7f" name="Advanced Possession" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Units of Possessed from The Tormented have WS and I 5, and the Rending special rule. However, any unit of Possessed from the Tormented that is not locked in combat at the start of its turn must take a Leadership test. If it fails, the unit can only move D6" in the Movement Phase as it is wracked with mutative spasms. Units that are within 18" of the Formation's Daemon Prince pass this test automatically.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
