            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Movement phase, pick the bearer or a single friendly Infantry unit within 12" of the bearer. For the duration of the phase, that unit has the Jump unit type.</characteristic>
