          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="d1aa-893f-74ca-f092-f9b7f" name="Bane of Wisdom" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Against non-vehicle targets, the S value of the Seer's Bane is equal to the bearer's Leadership characteristic, and all To Wound rolls are made against the target's Leadership characteristic instead of their Toughness. However, use the target's Toughness values as normal for determining whether or not the Seer's Bane inflicts Instant Death</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
