                      <characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">The Dark Herald and any unit with the Legiones Astartes (Blackshields) special rule within 12" have the Fear rule and add 1 to their leadership to a max of 10.  </characteristic></characteristics></profile>
                  </profiles>
