      <rules>
        <rule id="mh-rad-chaos-space-marines-20d5-4b71-80fe-e138" name="Anvillus Pattern Dreadclaw Drop Pod (Ambiguity)" hidden="false">
          <description>Ambiguity of 100pts cost for SoH in Legions book rather than the full 115 cost on Anvilus Droppods if taken as Dedicated Transports for Justaerin Terminator Squad, Legion Terminator Squad, Legion Dreadnought (Talon of 1 only), Legion Seeker Squad, Reaver Attack Squad &amp; Legion Command Squads.
If this option is selected then the cost of all Anvilus is increased back to the 115 only needs to be selected once per army.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="0.0" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
