          <characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">All flame weapons (flamers, Heavy flamers, hand flamers, combi-flamers, or Flamestorm Cannons) in a unit or on a vehicle may be upgraded to Chem-munitions.  All eligible weapons must be upgraded. Weapons with this rule gain both Shred and Gets Hot special rules. </characteristic></characteristics></profile>
