    <selectionEntry id="mh-rad-chaos-space-marines-aa9c-0372-fce4-e057-night-" name="Contekar Terminator Elite" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <rules>
        <rule id="mh-rad-chaos-space-marines-3f17-8f46-12e8-c5cf-night-" name="Lords of the Night" publicationId="690c-3e82-3080-6bc0" page="181" hidden="false">
          <description>A single Contekar Terminator Elite unit numbering no more than 10 models may be taken as a compulsory HQ choice in an army in which neither Sevatar nor Konrad Curze is present.
In an army which contains Sevatar, a single Contekar Terminator Elite unit may be chosen instead of a Command squad as a bodyguard for Sevatar. This choice takes up a single Force Organisation choice with Sevatar but does not have to be deployed with him, and is treated as a separate unit during play.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="mh-rad-chaos-space-marines-cc9e-8ef0-6b6c-a112-night-" name="Implacable Advance" hidden="false" targetId="mh-rad-chaos-space-marines-5ecb-551d-0f68-3a79" type="rule" />
