              <characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">The Indomitan mantle grants the bearer the Eternal Warrior special rule, as well as a invulnerable save against any weapon with the Melta type.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
