              <characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">In addition to the standard rules for this armour type, the wearer gains the Eternal Warrior special rule and adds 1 to their Toughness characteristic against Shooting attacks.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
