Note: units with the Fearless ability are subject to the No Retreat! rule.</description></rule><rule id="428988d2-8e3b-e7ae-ae51-177f6216609f-6e3184a" name="Furious Charge" hidden="false" page="0"><description>In a turn in which they assaulted into combat they add +1 to both their Initiative and Strength characteristics when attacking in close combat (note that this has no effect on the Initiative tests for sweeping advances).</description></rule><rule id="27aa3986-6ac8-32c0-7dc3-a160554796cd-6e3184a" name="Mark of Khorne" hidden="false" page="0"><description>Confers Rage and Counter-attack (7th Ed wording)</description></rule></rules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="0f2dc0d4-a2f0-155d-e0ea-9d0afa800e66-6e3184a" name="Berzerker Champion" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="29" /></costs><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="0f2dc0d4-a2f0-155d-e0ea-9d0afa800e66-minSelections-6e3184a" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="0f2dc0d4-a2f0-155d-e0ea-9d0afa800e66-maxSelections-6e3184a" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="d460eb49-eae1-d31c-9dc1-c3abd475d871-6e3184a" name="Berserker Champion" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-556e697423232344415441232323" typeName="Unit" page="0"><characteristics><characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="mh6-556e6974205479706523232344415441232323">Infantry (Character)</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="mh6-575323232344415441232323">5</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="mh6-425323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="mh6-5323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="mh6-5423232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="m