Note: units with the Fearless ability are subject to the No Retreat! rule.</description></rule><rule id="ae98ecc3-5d5d-dc61-e6e3-c575e077cc85-6eec309" name="Veterans of the Long War" hidden="false" page="0"><description>Models with this rule have +1 Ld and Hatred (Space Marines)
This Hatred applies for the following books:
Codex: Space Marines
Codex: Dark Angels
Codex: Space Wolves
Codex: Blood Angels
Codex: Grey Knights (7th Ed wording)</description></rule><rule id="0f04f9f0-f3ee-ba32-5f8e-2fd4d6758fa4-6eec309" name="Slow and Purposeful" hidden="false" page="0"><description>Models with this special rule are relentless. However, they always count as moving through difficult terrain (including in assaults). Remember that a slow and purposeful independent character will cause any unit he joins to move at his speed (and vice versa) as units have to move at the speed of the slowest model.</description></rule><rule id="af7583fe-a15b-e165-a30e-d9320d56df45-6eec309" name="Mark of Tzeentch" hidden="false" page="0"><description>Improves invunerable saves by +1 (to 3++). Confers a 6+ Invunerable if no existing save is present. (7th Ed wording)</description></rule></rules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ecb4090d-1c28-01ff-81e6-815da6c45b7b-6eec309" name="Aspiring Sorcerer" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="58" /></costs><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="ecb4090d-1c28-01ff-81e6-815da6c45b7b-minSelections-6eec309" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="ecb4090d-1c28-01ff-81e6-815da6c45b7b-maxSelections-6eec309" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="d1f30e42-e670-ec2b-5212-4794e274ceb2-6eec309" name="Aspiring Sorcerer" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-556e697423232344415441232323" typeName="Unit" page="0"><characteristics><characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="mh6-556e6974205479706523232344415441232323">Infantry (Character), Psyker Level 1</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="mh6-575323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="mh6-425323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="mh6-532323234